      "raw_text": "[8:15PM] #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good as you descend the Dornan Long Bridge inwards Fadeyi, then through Onipan, Palmgrove, Obanikoro, Anthony, Idiroko, Maryland Mall inwards Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way via the Service Lane.\n\nMovement on the Main Carriage is good through the independence Tunnel, Odo Iyalaro, New Garage, to Ojota. \n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
